# 🧠 AI Voice Assistant (Python + Streamlit)

A real-time AI voice assistant that listens, understands, and responds using OpenAI and ElevenLabs.

## 🔧 Features
- 🎧 Voice input using `SpeechRecognition`
- 🧠 Smart responses via GPT (OpenAI or DeepSeek)
- 🗣️ Text-to-speech with ElevenLabs or pyttsx3
- 🎨 Streamlit GUI for easy interaction

---

## 🚀 Getting Started

### ✅ Install Requirements
```bash
pip install openai streamlit requests SpeechRecognition pyttsx3
